    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d920">

                <pb facs="0915" n="749" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg749"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 868.001C76/10</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé d’Affaires of Greece to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1033</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Royal Legation of Greece</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="julian gregorian" when="1917-06-14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 1/14, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: Deeply moved, I have
                    the honor to inform your excellency that His Majesty King Constantin, my august
                    sovereign, yielding to insuperable political necessity upon steps taken by three
                    of the great Powers, is leaving Greece accompanied by Her Majesty Queen Sophie
                    and His Royal Highness Crown Prince George.</p>
                <p>He leaves on the throne His Royal Highness Prince Alexander.</p>
                <p>His Majesty the new King took yesterday the oath provided by the
                    Constitution.</p>
                <p>The grief of the Greek people at their separation from a King to whom they were
                    devoted is unspeakable.</p>
                <p>Be pleased to accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Vouros</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
